      "duration": 2.48,
      "size": 39744,
      "text": "这里的 N 是一个不是完全平方的正整数，比如二、三、五。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "define",
      "line_id": "def-2",
      "filename": "define-def-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/define-def-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.0,
      "size": 31968,
      "text": "我们要找的，是同时让等式成立的整数对 x 和 y。"
    },
    {
