      "section_id": "cf",
      "line_id": "cf-3",
      "filename": "cf-cf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/cf-cf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.31,
      "size": 37008,
      "text": "沿着这些渐近分数寻找，第一个满足方程的，就是最小的基本解。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "recur",
