      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.17,
      "size": 34704,
      "text": "有一类方程，只允许整数登场，它们被称为丢番图方程。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.21,
      "size": 35424,
      "text": "它就是佩尔方程，形如 x 的平方减去 N 乘 y 的平方等于一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "define",
      "line_id": "def-3",
      "filename": "define-def-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/define-def-3.mp3",
      "duration": 1.84,
      "size": 29376,
      "text": "看似简单，却曾让无数数学家着迷了上千年。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "cf",
      "line_id": "cf-1",
      "filename": "cf-cf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/cf-cf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 1.57,
      "size": 25200,
      "text": "解开它的钥匙，是根号 N 的连分数展开。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "cf",
      "line_id": "cf-2",
      "filename": "cf-cf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/cf-cf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.44,
      "size": 39024,
      "text": "根号 N 的连分数是周期循环的，它的渐近分数越来越逼近真值。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "recur",
