      "path": "audio/narrations/pell-equation/yunxi/recur-rec-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.43,
      "size": 38880,
      "text": "把基本解看成 x 加 y 根号 N，不断自乘方，就滚出下一个又一个解。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "pell-equation",
      "section_id": "recur",
      "line_id": "rec-3",
